"It is a B-rank Rabbit skill: the Rabbit carries an item that has been entrusted to them."
"No one had picked it before Alden Thorn."
"Gorgon hinted at it by carrying Alden's bag, saying 'Let me take your luggage.'"
"The hint cost Gorgon pain and charred skin beneath his bindings."
"While the Rabbit carries an item entrusted by the target, the item is preserved."
"Its supplements: Proprioception +1.5, Agility +1, Visual Processing +1."
"Summoners are autotargeted; otherwise the Rabbit targets by name or by pointing a finger."
"A white halo marks the target; out of sight, a dot shows the target's direction."
"Retargeting, ending carriage or losing contact ends the entrustment."
"Entrustment needs only the target's request, not a handover or ownership."
"Something another person holds or controls cannot be entrusted."
"Carriage demands constant motion; preservation fades after a second or two of stillness."
"Hopping in place counts as carrying, but no part of the item may touch the floor."
"Preserved contents freeze in place: flames stop, food does not spoil, creatures stop."
"Others feel a preserved item as electricity and water mixed, and cannot pull contents out."
"A preserved person remembers nothing of it and cannot be healed by others while preserved."
"A container and its contents, or touching stacked things, count as one item."
"Blows to the item and volatile or magic-laden items weigh on the Rabbit's will."
"It protects the item, not the Rabbit."
"The Rabbit also carries magic tied to an item, if they believe it within the skill's purview."
"How the Rabbit perceives the skill shapes what it can do almost as much as the skill itself."
"Its English name is a poor rendering; the skill has an older Artonan name."
"De-affixing it by magic is forbidden and causes severe harm."
"Stationary objects are preserved instantly; thrown ones are caught first, then preserved."
"A thrown item known to be hazardous freezes truly instantly."
"Preserved momentum can be redirected by rotating the object."
"For a piggybacked pair it works only if the Rabbit targets the one carrying the rider."
"Preserved items count as part of the Rabbit in a teleport, bypassing hazardous-item permits."
"It lets the holder bring full authority to bear almost at once, even at level one."
"That risks exhaustion, collapse, and an explosion near the wrong item."
"Its halo is the holder's own authority, facilitated by the System."
"Items carried inside other things, like a pocket, stay preserved while carriage continues."
"Perception may shift only from one reasonable assumption about the skill's scope to another."
"Without the System, targeting persists as a felt lean of the universe toward the target."
"Re-running the skill's start lets its holder preserve two simple things at once."
"Entrustment lapses while the Rabbit sleeps and resumes when the item is handed back."
"The skill's structure is a rock-solid machine of bound authority, holding its user together."
